# bknr.datastore

An in-memory CLOS based data store.  Some documentation is linked from the ancient [web site](https://bknr.common-lisp.dev/).

# installing through quicklisp

Please use [Quicklisp](http://quicklisp.org/) to install bknr-datastore

We have decided to no longer accept issues or pull requests for this repository.  We are no longer using bknr.datastore because Common Lisp is not a great target for LLM based development tools, and we're basically just leaving it here as a monument of better times, when humans wrote code and the code was fun (and, as we think, beautiful).

Some forks of bknr.datastore exist and are being used.  Feel free to create your own.
